CompileFlags:
  Compiler: clang++
  Add:
    - -xc++
    - -std=gnu++11
    - -D__AVR__
    - -D__AVR_ATmega328P__
    - -DARDUINO=10819
    - -DARDUINO_AVR_UNO
    - -DARDUINO_ARCH_AVR
    - -DF_CPU=16000000L
    - -I/Users/kenura/Library/Arduino15/packages/arduino/hardware/avr/1.8.8/cores/arduino
    - -I/Users/kenura/Library/Arduino15/packages/arduino/hardware/avr/1.8.8/variants/standard
    - -I/Users/kenura/Library/Arduino15/packages/arduino/tools/avr-gcc/7.3.0-atmel3.6.1-arduino7/avr/include
    - -I/Users/kenura/Documents/Arduino/libraries/OneWire
    - -I/Users/kenura/Documents/Arduino/libraries/DallasTemperature
  Remove: [-march=*, -mcpu=*]
Diagnostics:
  Suppress: [pp_file_not_found_with_hint]
